releases.notes:
- 修复了通过路由器接受信号的文本终端在接收脉冲信号时产生持续信号的问题；
- 材料确认界面改为使用1t刷新库存避免材料被取走后还能按确认的问题；
- 兼容赛博护目镜，使其从仓管提交的大于3*3的配方能被批量合成器正确识别，且未安装额外仪表时，模板仪表也能用赛博护目镜的大配方合成功能；
- 修复批量动力合成器的配方大小识别逻辑，使其能正确识别非矩形配方并正确分配合成阵列内的合成器；
- 阻止流体包裹在物品栏内被快速拆包；
- 修复在sable的物理结构上使用路由器时失效的问题；
——————————————————————————————————————————————————
- Fixed an issue where Labeled Redstone Links receiving pulse signals through a Redstone Link Router would remain continuously powered;
- Changed the materials confirmation screen to refresh inventory every tick, preventing confirmations after required materials have been removed;
- Added Create Cyber Goggles compatibility: recipes larger than 3×3 submitted from the Stock Keeper can now be correctly recognized by the Batch Mechanical Crafter. When Extra Gauges is not installed, the Template Panel can also use Create Cyber Goggles' large-recipe crafting feature;
- Fixed recipe-size detection in the Batch Mechanical Crafter, allowing it to correctly identify non-rectangular recipes and assign Mechanical Crafters within the crafting array appropriately;
- Prevented Fluid Logistics packages from being quick-unpacked in the inventory;
- Fixed Redstone Link Routers not functioning on Sable physical structures.

修复了工作仓库在具有中间节点的初始原料时的需求计算错误；
修复了批量动力合成器面对有充足空间的容器时依旧成组输出的问题；
添加了批量理包机与动力臂的兼容；
修复了存在模板的情况下仓管合成配方请求的异常问题；
Fixed a demand calculation error in the Work Warehouse when initial ingredients have intermediate nodes;
Fixed an issue where the Batch Mechanical Crafter still output in groups even when facing a container with ample space;
Added Mechanical Arm compatibility for the Batch Repackager;
Fixed an issue where Stock Keeper's crafting recipe requests behaved abnormally when templates were present;
